\section{Frozen question and decision}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

The primary endpoint averages relative RMSE improvement at 15, 30, and
60 minutes. The 5-minute result is an anchor. Horizon v1 succeeds only if
the operational-weather arm beats both its hard-zero history arm and the
stronger operational-weather MLP/LightGBM control by at least 2\%, both
paired 24-hour block-bootstrap intervals are above zero, both neural seeds
move in the same direction, 80\% coverage stays between 70\% and 90\%, and
bias, tail MAE, CRPS, and stability do not materially regress.

