\section{Feature definitions and proxy audit}
\textbf{History only} contains six \cn{} levels plus first differences and
elapsed cadence. \textbf{Operational weather} additionally contains
Dir\_10m, Spd\_10m, P\_2m, T\_2m, RH\_2m, and Tdew\_2m; direction is encoded
as sine and cosine. Covariances, QC flags, counts, water-vapor instrument
channels, and diagnostics were excluded from every learned primary arm.

The descriptive proxy audit used the training block only. Correlation is not
proof of leakage, but high association in a field derived from the same
instrument stream is a warning against including it.

