\section{Limitations and recommendation}
\begin{itemize}
\item The assessment block spans less than two days and cannot represent all
seasons or turbulence regimes.
\item A 24-hour circular block bootstrap respects local dependence but cannot
create independent weather episodes.
\item Two neural seeds check direction and gross instability, not the full
training distribution.
\item Surface-layer, single-site evidence does not establish vertical-profile,
path-integrated, cross-instrument, or deployment performance.
\item The feature audit is associational; excluded target-proxy candidates
were never used for primary training.
\end{itemize}

